WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.312
Welcome to Grade 3 English, Unit
1: All About Me and My Family.

2
00:00:04.392 --> 00:00:09.261
In this unit you will learn how to
talk about yourself and your family,

3
00:00:09.341 --> 00:00:15.465
and about the values that hold a family and
a school together: respect, honour, and duty.

4
00:00:15.545 --> 00:00:22.436
You will learn how to behave well in public and in
private, and how to talk about health and safety.

5
00:00:22.516 --> 00:00:30.592
By the end you will introduce your family, ask Wh- questions,
give clear instructions, and share what matters to you,

6
00:00:30.672 --> 00:00:33.311
just as Amal does in this unit's story.

7
00:00:33.391 --> 00:00:39.167
In this short lecture, preview the key
ideas and prepare for the independent lesson.

8
00:00:39.247 --> 00:00:46.878
By the end of this unit, you will be able to talk about
the people in your family and what you do together.

9
00:00:46.958 --> 00:00:52.283
You will also use new words like
respect, honour, duty, health, and safety.

10
00:00:52.363 --> 00:00:58.553
You will also say what is happening now,
using the present continuous (“I am helping.”)

11
00:00:58.633 --> 00:01:01.220
Keep these goals in mind as you work.

12
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:07.466
Your vocabulary work begins with these words:
family, parent, friend, student, junior, senior.

13
00:01:07.546 --> 00:01:13.181
Listen to each word, look at what it means,
and try to use it when you talk and write.

14
00:01:13.261 --> 00:01:17.976
The reading sequence includes My
Family and Good Behaviour at School.

15
00:01:18.056 --> 00:01:22.841
Read slowly, look at the pictures,
and find the big idea in each text.

16
00:01:22.921 --> 00:01:27.010
When you answer a question, point to the words that show it.

17
00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:31.615
The first language focus is Present
Continuous (what is happening now).

18
00:01:31.695 --> 00:01:36.868
We use the present continuous to talk
about actions that are happening right now.

19
00:01:36.948 --> 00:01:43.353
It helps us say exactly what people are doing at
this moment, like “The student is showing respect.”

20
00:01:43.433 --> 00:01:47.568
Look at the examples, then try
the pattern in your own sentences.

21
00:01:47.648 --> 00:01:52.095
In speaking, you will complete
Speaking 1 — Introduce Your Family.

22
00:01:52.175 --> 00:01:55.524
Say your ideas clearly and listen to your partner.

23
00:01:55.604 --> 00:02:02.519
In writing, you will draw, trace, copy or write,
then check your work with a grown-up or the AI tutor.

24
00:02:02.599 --> 00:02:04.168
You are ready to begin.

25
00:02:04.248 --> 00:02:11.121
Start with the words, then the reading and the
questions, then the grammar, speaking and writing.

26
00:02:11.201 --> 00:02:18.218
Ask the AI tutor for help any time, and bring your
questions to a live session too if you join one.
